---
config:
  theme: redux
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend (Gradio)
    participant B as Backend
    participant STT as Whisper (STT)
    participant VS as Chroma (Vector Store)
    participant E as Embeddings (Nomic / OpenCLIP)
    participant LMM as Multimodal LLM (Ollama)

    %% User interaction
    U->>F: Submit query (text or audio)

    %% Audio processing
    alt Audio input
        F->>STT: Transcribe audio
        STT->>F: Return text
    end

    %% Backend processing
    F->>B: Send query

    %% Embedding + retrieval
    B->>E: Generate query embeddings (text)
    E->>VS: Semantic search
    VS->>B: Return relevant docs (text + images)

    %% LLM generation
    B->>LMM: Query + retrieved context
    LMM->>B: Generate multimodal response

    %% Response
    B->>F: Send response (text + images)
    F->>U: Display results